  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.8.0 - Text entry and data for real apps. TextField gains opt-in shell line-editing keys (Ctrl+A/E/U/K/W, Ctrl+Left/Right), a prefilled value the first key replaces (SelectAll), a reveal key for masked values, Enter to submit (Submitted), a grapheme length limit (MaxLength), and validation (Validator, Validate, Error). Pastes can reach the focused widget (IPasteTarget, TuiApplication.RoutePasteToFocus, DialogModal.PasteTarget). FuzzyList becomes a full picker: detail text, disabled items, multi-select, an items provider, Enter to choose, paste, line-editing keys, and theme styles. DataTable pages locally or one server page at a time (PagingMode, BindPage, PageRequested) with a paging bar, load and error states, retry, marks across pages, and DataTableLoader for the async plumbing; columns gain stable keys, visibility, a chooser, and a keyboard column cursor. Additive; new behavior is opt-in, and the few visible changes are listed under Changed. Full release history: https://github.com/jchristn/TUIKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
